              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nditĩa kũmban’ya onthe a maku, we Yakovo; nditĩa kũmban’ya ũtialo wa Isilaeli; ngamomban’ya vamwe ta malondu ma Mbosila, ta ndĩthya ya mbũi na malondu katĩ wa kĩsesi kyayo; makookĩlya kĩuumo kĩnene nũndũ wa andũ kwingĩva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
